SERVICES=Manicure ($25, 45 min)|Pedicure ($35, 60 min)|Full Set Acrylic ($55, 90 min)|Gel Manicure ($40, 60 min)|Full Set + Pedicure ($80, 120 min)|Nail Art (from $10, +20 min)

